  "body": "It has been used as attack vector in the past and it doesn't appear to be used enough to justify the ongoing cost. https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/3011#issuecomment-331391908 has more details and indication of support by Chrome, Edge, and Firefox.\r\n\r\nIt seems likely we'll go down this path so the need to fix #1950 goes away, but let's leave it open until two browsers have actually removed support. (Also close #3011 when that happens.)\r\n\r\ncc @mikewest @dveditz @bsittler",
